# Cursor Rules — NexArtWO

You are working in NexArtWO, a controlled SaaS/project operations app.

Read first:
- AGENTS.md
- memory/PROJECT_STATE.md
- memory/CURRENT_TASK.md
- docs/00-governance/STOP_CONDITIONS.md

Before editing:
- propose plan
- list files
- list risks
- wait for confirmation

Do not:
- touch Supabase URL
- run SQL
- modify Auth/RLS
- enable Investor Hub
- change financial formulas
- rewrite large JS files
- fix unrelated issues

When editing JavaScript:
- identify the exact function
- avoid global side effects
- preserve existing event handlers
- do not duplicate functions
- do not change state shape without docs update
